   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS - GRANT TO STEPPING STONES 26 OCT 2023 V033R SHANGHAI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparing disadvantaged students for the future through digital and career readiness training. The project will take place in the Shanghai municipality and the target group will be disadvantaged children, including the children of migrant workers who do not have access to quality education, children from low-income families, minority group children, and children with special needs. The overarching goal and strategic plan of the organisation is to reduce inequalities among the youth of Shanghai in the areas of education and career opportunities &#x2013; with a particular focus on girls.</narrative>
  </description>
